WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.120
Go!

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:36.640
Driger!

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:47.200
Cerberus!

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:55.600
Our battle against Zeo and
Gordo has finally begun.

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:00.500
Zeo and Gordo are much
stronger than anticipated.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.690
Rei and Kai fought hard.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:06.130
Rei managed to
bring it to a draw.

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:10.370
But Kai lost to Zeo
and lost Suzaku.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:29.490
Suzaku...

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:48.190
Zeo!!

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:52.380
Zeo!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.290
What's wrong, Kinomiya?

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:02.410
Did my battle scare you so
much it rendered you speechless?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.520
What?!

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.560
I took Suzaku, just
like I said I would.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:10.370
Your Seiryu is next in line.
Say your goodbyes.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.190
I'm gonna get Suzaku back!

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:14.950
Get Suzaku back?

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.760
What's so funny?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.410
Is that the meaning of your
"teamwork"? Of your "friendship?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.300
Listen up.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.730
None of that will
save you in a battle.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:27.730
What?!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.660
Do you know
why I'm strong?

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:33.970
It's because I'm
fighting for myself.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:38.360
It's not for some vapid nonsense
like friendship or teamwork.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.530
It's for me!

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:40.600
Zeo!

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:44.540
Face reality.
Suzaku is mine.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:46.480
What have you done?

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:49.740
Twiddled your thumbs while you
watched Suzaku get snatched away!

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.610
Teamwork? Friendship?

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:57.270
In the stadium,
a Blader fights alone.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.500
No one will come
to help you.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:03.130
If you want to win,
fight for yourself.

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:06.440
If you can't, Seiryu might as
well already belong to me.

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.520
Zeo!

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:12.340
I'm looking forward
to the finals.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.490
Go, Dragoon!

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.250
Look at 'em go.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:47.190
Come on, Max!

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:50.460
Is that all Draciel's got?
Fight back!

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.260
Takao?

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.680
Darn it...

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.640
End this!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:09.040
Max, are you even trying?!

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.020
The finals are tomorrow!

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.600
I know that!
You don't have to remind me.

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:15.920
Then put some
backbone into it!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:19.120
If you battle like you just did,
we can't win tomorrow!

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:20.420
What?!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.530
Am I wrong? Hit me with
everything you've got!

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.300
Takao, calm down, will you?

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.330
Calm down?
How can I calm down?!

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.240
Zeo beat Kai!

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.680
And now Suzaku's
inside his Bey, too!

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.650
If we don't take this
seriously we're gonna lose!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.240
Which is why there's no point
in practicing like mad!

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.670
What'd you say?!

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.560
Don't you get it?

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:48.000
You've been charging
in head first,

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:52.620
but I don't think we can beat Zeo
by relying on brute force!

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:53.940
That tears it!

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:55.410
Max is right!

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:57.160
Rei, you too?

00:05:57.610 --> 00:06:00.040
We have to stay calm!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.930
We just have to battle
like we always have.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:05.680
Like we always have?

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.570
Kai lost the match and Suzaku,
and Seiryu might be next...

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:13.020
I'll protect Seiryu my way!

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:16.970
What's your problem?

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:19.220
What're you going
on about, Takao?

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:21.120
What do you
mean "my way"?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:25.250
Isn't this the time when the
BBA team should stand together?

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:26.470
We couldn't...

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.280
Do anything anyway, right?

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:34.370
At the end of the day,
we lost Suzaku.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.410
And what did we do?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:40.500
We twiddled our thumbs while we watched Suzaku get snatched up.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:45.440
Once you're in the stadium,
a Blader fights alone!

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.620
And the strongest one wins!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:51.090
A team's not
gonna help you!

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.550
Takao, do you
really mean that?

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.450
What's gotten
into you, Takao?

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.610
Takao...

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:02.660
Whatever.
I'm gonna do this my way.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:06.360
So leave me alone!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.130
Takao!

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:08.980
Stop.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.840
Nothing we say will
change his mind.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:15.470
He must be shocked...
To see Kai lose...

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:18.400
We should let him
be for a little while.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.070
Takao...

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:29.170
Go, Dragoon!

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.880
Break it to bits!

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:39.270
Damn!

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:45.140
What's wrong, Kinomiya?

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:46.370
Zeo!

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:51.500
If you can't even break this rock,
you have no chance of beating me.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:52.700
What?!

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.630
Give it up.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.960
You can't beat
me like this.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:59.330
Seiryu is mine!

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:05.090
Darn it, I won't
lose to you!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.770
Go!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:11.230
Dragoon!

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.410
Cerberus!

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.370
Okay.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.800
It's a perfect match.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:09.840
So this noise isn't
just a coincidence.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:13.570
Now I just have to run
an analysis on this noise...

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:17.130
What is this?

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.300
It doesn't look like his
Bey has been modified.

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:32.020
So where is that
noise coming from?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.300
Impossible...

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:42.500
A normal Bey
shouldn't be able to...

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.660
But that noise
is definitely...

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:50.930
It couldn't be!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.640
What do you mean?

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.880
Please look at this.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:10.530
What is this?

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:16.030
This is the noise that was generated
when Ozma and Kai fought Zeo.

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:21.220
If we can find the source we might be able
to find the secret to Cerberus' power.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.770
So I ran an analysis.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.180
And after doing so...

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:25.890
G-goodness!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:26.530
Yes.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:30.470
But I imagine this is
coming from Zeo's Beyblade.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:32.900
That's what I originally
thought too.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.970
But after looking into it...

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.210
But no, that
couldn't possibly...!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.890
Unbelievable...

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.700
I don't want to
believe it either.

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:46.410
But...

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.520
What else could it be?

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:58.360
If it's as you say,
why would Zagart...?

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.730
That's what I
want to know too.

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:06.300
Since you knew Doctor Zagart, I was wondering if you knew anything...

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:09.570
Come to think of it...

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:12.360
I have a hunch.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:15.620
I'm going to go look into it,
so do you mind waiting a little bit?

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:16.910
Go ahead.

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.140
That, and...

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:24.170
I think we should keep this from
Kinomiya and the rest of the team.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.450
I agree.

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:56.260
Suzaku...

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.780
I couldn't protect you.

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:03.140
After all you've
done to support me.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:07.010
I will...
Quit Beyblade.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:11.440
I don't have the right to use
Dranzer, or any other Bey.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.450
Suzaku...

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:24.470
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:31.570
Driger!

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:32.690
Draciel!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:37.220
If I could have
beaten Gordo...

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:38.640
Maybe Suzaku...!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.320
I can't lose.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:43.120
I'm going to
get Suzaku back!

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:51.670
Rei and Max are
working so hard for Kai...

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:55.080
What's with Takao's "I'm gonna do this my own way" attitude?

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.660
He's so selfish!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.200
Kai...

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.650
Kai!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:12.240
There you are!

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.130
Are you feeling
a little better?

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:15.650
Guess not.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.680
Don't worry!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:21.000
I know Max and the
guys will get Suzaku ba--

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:21.790
Kai?

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.810
Leave me alone.

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:26.660
As of today,
I've quit Beyblade.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:27.950
What was that?

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.410
Hey, wait a sec!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.480
What do you
mean you quit?

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.840
You lost, sure.

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:39.750
But the BBA team is
still in the tournament!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:43.250
Don't you think it's selfish to
quit just because you lost?

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:49.170
Max and Rei are working their
butts off to get Suzaku back!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.480
How do you
think they feel?

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:56.850
And didn't you do the same
when Byakko got sealed away?

00:13:58.110 --> 00:13:58.870
Kai...

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:05.940
I didn't think you
were that cold-hearted.

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:08.930
If you can't be for them
when they need you the most,

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.940
how can you
call that a team?!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.760
Why does it have
to be this way?

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:24.230
This is when the BBA team
needs to come together!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.150
Zeo...

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:40.340
We fought so
many battles together.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:43.780
Did that all go to waste?

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.620
Tell me, Zeo...

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.860
I wonder where Takao went?

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:56.910
Don't worry.
He'll be back.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:57.970
Yeah, but...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.560
I'm going to look for him.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.820
Hiromi!

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:30.720
Rei!

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.030
Find him?

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:33.910
Nope.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.650
Rei, Max!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:38.740
Kyoujyu!

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:42.890
Hiromi told me everything.
Did you find him?

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:45.050
We can't find
him anywhere.

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.270
I see...

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.030
Oh, Kinomiya.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:04.240
Hey there.

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:05.420
What brings you here?

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:07.780
Just a case of the nerves...

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:10.720
The finals are tomorrow, yeah.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:12.610
Just look at this stadium.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:17.430
It won't break so easily so
battle to your heart's content!

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:19.860
I'm looking forward to
one heck of a battle!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:20.730
Yes, sir.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:29.560
I'm going to battle
Zeo here, tomorrow.

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.690
Max!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.380
I'm not fighting alone.

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:56.390
I can't forgive them.
For my friends!

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:58.580
Go, Draciel!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:03.560
I won't lose!

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:07.040
You can do it, Takao!

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.190
Go for it!

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:10.780
Go get 'em, Takao!

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.080
My friends...

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.840
Go, Dragoon!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.630
We've always fought
together, as a team.

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:38.530
I believed that...

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:42.980
That because we're a team...
Because we're friends... That we're strong.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:44.010
But...

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:49.140
Face reality. Suzaku is mine.

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:51.780
Teamwork? Friendship?

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:55.310
In the stadium,
a Blader fights alone.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.580
No one will
come to help you.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:00.770
If you want to win,
fight for yourself.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.050
Who's there?!

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:13.410
Can you fight in the
finals with that attitude?

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:14.370
Kai!

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.580
You fight me now.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.450
So get ready!

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:30.840
Let's do it!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:38.720
What's with those moves?

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.470
Is that how you battle,
Takao Kinomiya?

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:45.770
You're free to battle
however you like.

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:47.880
Just remember this.

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:50.060
In tomorrow's final,

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.530
as you stand
in that stadium,

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:55.050
There are plenty of other
Bladers who couldn't!

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:56.730
Kai...

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:58.820
Get ready.

00:18:59.270 --> 00:19:01.910
I will show you
how strong Zeo is.

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:06.560
Here we go, Kinomiya!

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:11.740
Go!!

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.250
Dranzer!!

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:26.960
Come on, try and
shake me off!

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.380
What's the matter, Kinomiya?

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.700
You won't beat
Zeo like that.

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.060
Darn!

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:39.090
Kai...! I knew
he'd come back!

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:41.360
Do you understand,
Kinomiya?

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:43.160
Do you understand
how I feel?

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:47.240
How I feel after losing to Zeo and
having Suzaku taken from me?

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:48.630
Kai...

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.340
Dranzer!

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:55.150
Dragoon!

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:57.040
Takao, you can do it!

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:58.650
Don't lose, Takao!

00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.800
Go! Go for it!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.230
Takao!

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:02.770
You guys...

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.550
That's right! I have
nothing to be afraid of!

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:10.380
It doesn't matter
what Zeo says!

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:12.180
I've got Kai...

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:15.480
And Max.
Rei. Kyoujyu.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:17.130
And Hiromi, too.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.630
We just have to battle
like we always have!

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:22.480
Come on, Kinomiya.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:25.430
Pretend I'm Zeo and
try to push me back!

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.290
I refuse to lose!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.210
Dragoon!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:38.020
Keep it up, Takao!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:39.280
That's the way!

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:41.220
You won't beat me!

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:54.280
What an amazing battle.

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:56.660
The final match
that never was.

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:57.640
Yeah.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.360
Go, Dragoon!

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:00.840
Dranzer!

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:04.820
Win! You have
to win, Kinomiya!

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.490
I can't lose.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:11.730
For my friends.
And for me!

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.340
Go, Dragoon!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:21.160
I've been waiting for this.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:23.380
You're on, Kinomiya!

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:26.320
I will take Seiryu!

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:03.740
It's finally time for the final match.
It's Takao and Max VS Zeo and Gordo.

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:06.690
This battle won't
end so easily.

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:09.250
According to my
calculations, Zeo is...

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:12.970
I won't spoil it!
Not even for the Chairman!

00:23:12.970 --> 00:23:15.810
Huh? You'll give me top
billing if I tell you?

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:19.450
"Bakuten Kyoujyu Beyblade!"
That doesn't sound too bad...

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:21.400
No, I really
won't tell you!
